> 4)For 3.1:  Identified luckstones should keep you apprised of your
> luck: blessed luckstone (+8)  or blessed luckstone (-2).  Cursed
> luckstones might give false info until they are blessed or neutral, at
> which time they will then give correct luck stats.

I don't think this is how they work. They affect the timeout of your luck. 
Luck moves towards 0 one point every n turns. If blessed luckstone, bad luck
times out but good luck doesn't. If normal, bith time out. If cursed,
good luck times out, bad luck doesn't.

